<title>UK: ICCO invites bids for up to 4,250 tonnes of cocoa.</title>
<headline>ICCO invites bids for up to 4,250 tonnes of cocoa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) said on Wednesday it was inviting bids for up to 4,250 tonnes of cocoa by 1140 GMT on Thursday. It said the offer related to the list published on June 24. Acceptances will be communicated to the parties concerned by 1300 GMT Thursday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
